{"unit_id":"LoserFox__telegram#card-zh","repo":"LoserFox/telegram","commit":"a0a9ca11e427b62217250e2e561f6ad3c49d13f2","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"@loserfox/telegram 是把 Telegram 聊天接入 DSH agent 会话的后台插件，支持 web、headless 等加载该组合插件的 profile。它通过 Bot API 长轮询接收授权用户的文本消息，为每个聊天创建或复用独立 agent 会话，并将回复发送回聊天。主要功能包括白名单访问控制、/start、/new、/clear 与 /help 命令、Markdown 子集转 HTML、长回复分片和输入状态提示。适合希望从聊天窗口使用 DSH agent 的用户；需要配置 Telegram bot token，并由宿主提供 agents 服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:21-25","src/bridge.ts:138-179","src/bridge.ts:186-259"]}
{"unit_id":"LoserFox__telegram#card-en","repo":"LoserFox/telegram","commit":"a0a9ca11e427b62217250e2e561f6ad3c49d13f2","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"@loserfox/telegram connects chat messages to DSH agent sessions. It polls the Bot API, keeps a session per chat, and sends replies back. It supports user allowlists, session commands, formatted and split replies, and typing indicators. Configure a bot token and provide the host agents service.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:21-25","src/bridge.ts:138-179","src/bridge.ts:186-259"]}
